{"id":"n42173-3-7","stage":4,"title":"단련 · 磨炼","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n42173-3-7-1","ko":"매일 야근을 하면 너무 힘들지 않아요?","zh":"每天加班不会太辛苦吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"매일","meaning":"天天，每日","explanation":"매일：天天，每日","readings":[{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58104","senseId":"1","lemma":"매일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"매일","audio":"/audio/d5d6a44c9a8924522b29.mp3"}},{"text":"야근을","meaning":"加班","explanation":"야근：加班；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"야근","audio":"/audio/e8aeeb6fc5aa42e226b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90303","senseId":"1","lemma":"야근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"야근을","audio":"/audio/0b51441a9a56ccb1685f.mp3"}},{"text":"하면","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하면","audio":"/audio/01692c67203f44175054.mp3"}},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}},{"text":"힘들지","meaning":"累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力","explanation":"힘들다：累，费力，费劲，辛苦，用力；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"힘들다","audio":"/audio/8eec39c3609a6c71740f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91737","senseId":"1","lemma":"힘들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"힘들지","audio":"/audio/b3d57a7eddab4c9b3faf.mp3"}},{"text":"않아요?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","ori